{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LEzhjZrFBJcMFBXk678qwP","type":"tool_result","content":"/private/var/folders/dl/cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn/T/go-unix-utils-worktrees/5572/docs/specs/software-requirements/srd097-who.yaml:  - G2: Support header display, idle time, and boot time options.\n/private/var/folders/dl/cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn/T/go-unix-utils-worktrees/5572/docs/specs/software-requirements/srd097-who.yaml:          text: \"-u or --users must show idle time for each user. Idle time is displayed as HH:MM, '.' for active (< 1 minute), or 'old' for > 24 hours.\"\n/private/var/folders/dl/cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn/T/go-unix-utils-worktrees/5572/docs/specs/software-requirements/srd096-users.yaml:  - cmd/users does not show idle time, terminal, or remote host information; use who for that.\n/private/var/folders/dl/cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn/T/go-unix-utils-worktrees/5572/docs/specs/software-requirements/srd098-pinky.yaml:          text: Must display logged-in users in short format by default, showing login name, terminal, idle time, login time, and remote host, one line per user.\n/private/var/folders/dl/cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn/T/go-unix-utils-worktrees/5572/docs/specs/software-requirements/srd098-pinky.yaml:          text: \"-l must display long format output showing login name, real name (from GECOS), terminal, idle time, login time, office location, and office phone from the passwd entry.\"","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01An2mYVSBpqpTqc5kup5L1i","session_id":"fd2a7807-abd7-4366-bdbe-94cf099e533b","uuid":"3438637c-c7cb-4a76-8c6f-8b43eb7e5b7e","timestamp":"2026-05-24T03:39:06.380Z"}
